(SCHEDULE A: SERVICE LEVEL AGREEMENT & PRICING MATRIX) '
() '
(1. Availability Commitment. Service Provider guarantees 99.95% monthly uptime for all production workloads.) '
(2. Service Credits. Failure to meet the availability target entitles Customer to a 10% credit of the monthly subscription fee for each 0.1% downtime exceeding the threshold.) '
(3. Fee Schedule: Base platform retainer is $50,000 per calendar quarter, payable net thirty \(30\) days from invoice receipt.) '
(4. Payment Term in Clause 4: All supplemental consulting services shall be billed at $250/hour, reconciled bi-weekly.) '
() '
